# I'm Going app — environment (copy to .env for local overrides)
# Used by Expo (EXPO_PUBLIC_* are inlined at bundle time).
# The backend API. Dev default: local Fastify on 8081 (PORT=8081 in server/.env).
# For the Expo web preview, the dev server runs on 8082 and this points at 8081.
# On a physical device, use the dev machine's LAN IP instead of 127.0.0.1.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8081